<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech to pay CZK 10/share gross dividend.</title>
<headline>Czech to pay CZK 10/share gross dividend.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech savings bank Ceska Sporitelna a.s. on Monday said it would pay a gross dividend for 1996 of 10 crowns per share, double its five crown per share dividend in 1995.</p>
</text>
